t":"2026-10-21T04:10:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:10:20Z"},{"id":661312397,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84natON","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":564,"digest":"sha256:abddbb76c9aab8efbde30a1781ebb53ecf97e2442b6603387d0fed0dc407d599","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-10-21T04:10:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:10:21Z"}],"body":"本版用 Go 1.26.10 重新构建，修复标准库证书验证对已不再受信任的中间证书的处理，并修好历史搜索读不到会话时误报“没有匹配”和多进程下会话从搜索里消失的问题。\n\n## 修复\n\n- 构建改用 Go 1.26.10，修复标准库证书验证 crypto/x509 对已不再受信任的中间证书的处理（GO-2026-6809）。关联 #14034。\n- 会话记录读不出来时，历史搜索不再说「没有匹配」，而是先提示索引不完整，并把该会话标为损坏、稍后自动重试。关联 #14023 by @chuiwenwei。\n- 两个进程共用一个历史索引时，另一个进程刚索引的会话不再被误判为「已删除」而从历史搜索里消失；只有确认文件不存在才会被标记缺失。关联 #14024 by @chuiwenwei。\n- 侧栏“项目”标题行里的“+”和“更多操作”按钮悬停时现在是同一种高亮。关联 #14041 fixed in #14043 by @lancy69、#14043 by @lancy69。\n\n## 贡献者\n\n感谢本版本的贡献者：@chuiwenwei、@lancy69\n\n---\n\n<!-- lang:en -->\n\nThis release is rebuilt with Go 1.26.10, which fixes how certificate verification treats intermediate certificates that are no longer trusted, and fixes history search reporting no match for an unreadable transcript or losing a session another process had just indexed.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- builds now use Go 1.26.10, which fixes how crypto/x509 certificate verification treats intermediate certificates that are no longer trusted (GO-2026-6809). Refs #14034.\n- when a session's transcript cannot be read, history search no longer claims a miss; it says the index is incomplete, marks that session corrupt, and retries on the next scan. Refs #14023 by @chuiwenwei.\n- with two processes sharing one history index, a conversation the other process just indexed is no longer swept as deleted; only a file confirmed gone is marked missing. Refs #14024 by @chuiwenwei.\n- The sidebar's Projects header now highlights the \"+\" and more-actions buttons the same way on hover. Refs #14041 fixed in #14043 by @lancy69, #14043 by @lancy69.\n\n## Contributors\n\nThanks to this release's contributors: @chuiwenwei, @lancy69\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(studio): unify project header button highlights by @lancy69 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14043\n* fix(history): an unreadable transcript is a corrupt source, not no results by @chuiwenwei in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14023\n* fix(history): a scan must confirm absence before it marks a source missing by @chuiwenwei in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14024\n* build: use Go 1.26.10 for the crypto/x509 fix (GO-2026-6809) by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14050\n* docs(release): studio 2.47.1 notes by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/14057\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/compare/studio-v2.47.0...studio-v2.47.1\n\n\n---\n\n**macOS** 已用 Developer ID 签名并公证，打开时不需要清除隔离属性。**Windows** 的窗口、内核与安装器都经 Certum 代码签名证书做了 Authenticode 签名。**Linux** Debian 系从 `.deb` 安装，Fedora、RHEL、openSUSE 等从 `.rpm` 安装（`sudo dnf install ./ReasonixStudio-linux-amd64.rpm`）。x86_64 用文件名带 amd64 的包，aarch64（统信 UOS、麒麟等）用带 arm64 的包。也提供 `.AppImage`（只提供下载，不会自更新；需要 FUSE 2，或用 `--appimage-extract-and-run` 启动）。\n\n三个平台都能自更新：Linux 的 `.deb` 走自己的包（`.rpm` 的自更新尚未提供，请手动下载新包），Windows 运行下一个安装器，macOS 替换自身 bundle。\n","mentions_count":3}
